---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Me">
    <div class="about-layout">
        <header>
            <h1>About Me</h1>
            <dl>
                <dt>Class</dt>
                <dd>Software Developer</dd>
                <dt>Level</dt>
                <dd>Senior at UTA</dd>
                <dt>Description</dt>
                <dd>Developing software with creativity and purpose.</dd>
            </dl>
            
        </header>
        <main>
            <p>I'm a software developer who builds with purpose. I love making things that are interactive and memorable, whether it's a tool that makes someone's day easier, or a game that gives them something to look forward to. Even in the age of AI development, I think the ideas still have to come from people, so I treat creativity as a core value of good engineering.</p>
            <p>I'm a senior at the University of Texas at Arlington pursuing a bachelor's in Computer Science in the College of Engineering. I am currently helping develop a cross-disciplinary game between with different students across the university. I built and maintain a Discord bot that my TTRPG group uses for organization and communication, and has different functions to enable our game and activities. I also built a Flask version of this portfolio to teach me web development before diving into JavaScript.</p>
            <blockquote>
                <p>"In the same way that your heart feels and your mind thinks, you are the instrument by which the universe cares."</p>
                <cite>Brennan Lee Mulligan</cite>
            </blockquote>
        </main>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    .about-layout{
        max-width: 70rem;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
    }
</style>